# Copy to .env (never commit .env). Server secrets stay in Supabase Edge Function secrets, NEVER EXPO_PUBLIC_.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xyzcompany.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...
EXPO_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=phc_...
EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_IOS_KEY=appl_...
EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_ANDROID_KEY=goog_...
# Server-side only (supabase functions secrets set):
# GEMINI_API_KEY, FASHN_API_KEY (fallback), SHOPSTYLE_KEY, LTK_AFFILIATE_ID, RESEND_KEY, STRIPE_SECRET
# --- appended by security crew (used in code but missing here; append-only) ---
# Public (safe EXPO_PUBLIC_ — used by lib/, safe to embed):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST (default https://us.i.posthog.com; read lib/analytics.ts:114)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN (public by design; read lib/sentry.ts:28)
# Server-only (supabase secrets set — NEVER EXPO_PUBLIC_, never import in lib/):
# INNGEST_EVENT_KEY, INNGEST_SIGNING_KEY (render-tryon worker HMAC)
# REVENUECAT_WEBHOOK_SECRET (billing-rc bearer verify)
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET (Stripe-Signature HMAC, tolerance 300s)
# POSTHOG_API_KEY (server-authoritative lifecycle/revenue captures — billing-rc, affiliate-order)
# AFFILIATE_POSTBACK_SECRET (affiliate-order network postback bearer)
# SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (auto-injected; service_role via auth.ts:admin() only)
# ALLOW_SYNC_RENDER=false in prod (dev-only sync render path)
# Modal QA (configure only on a separate QA Supabase project; never EXPO_PUBLIC_):
# QA_MODAL_ENABLED=true, QA_MODAL_ENVIRONMENT=qa, QA_MODAL_USER_IDS=<approved-user-uuid,...>
# MODAL_QA_ENDPOINT=https://<private-modal-app>.modal.run
# MODAL_PROXY_TOKEN_ID, MODAL_PROXY_TOKEN_SECRET
# QA_MODAL_A100_USD_PER_SECOND=<confirmed Modal A100 rate>
# The client selector is embedded only by `eas build --profile qa-modal`;
# it is not a credential and remains protected by the backend account allowlist.
# DEV-ONLY login (lib/dev-auth.ts, never production — placeholders sign in nowhere):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DEV_EMAIL=dev@example.com
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DEV_PASS=dev-password-change-me
